### POST request to create a new patient record
POST http://localhost:4000/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientName": "John Doe",
  "patientAddress": "123 Main St",
  "patientEmail": "john.doe@example.com",
  "patientPhone": "555-1234",
  "patientGender": "Male",
  "patientDateOfBirth": "1990-01-01",
  "registerDate": "2023-01-01"
}

###

### GET request to retrieve all patient records
GET http://localhost:4000/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

###

### PUT request to update an existing patient record
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/patients/{patientID}
Content-type: application/json

{
  "patientName": "Jane Doe",
  "patientAddress": "456 Elm St",
  "patientEmail": "jane.doe@example.com"
}

###

### DELETE request to delete an existing patient record
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/patients/{patientID}
Content-Type: application/json

###